{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CemrfN3NoZXHbCDJDyGWo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! All tests pass. Here's a summary of the implementation:\n\n## Summary\n\nI've successfully implemented the shipment confirmation endpoint (`POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm`) according to the BE-003 requirements.\n\n### Changes Made:\n\n1. **`ApiError.kt`**: Added new error code `SHIPMENT_CANNOT_BE_CONFIRMED` for state transition errors.\n\n2. **`ShipmentController.kt`**: Added the `confirm` endpoint (lines 57-73) that:\n   - Returns 404 if the shipment doesn't exist\n   - Transitions `CREATED` → `CONFIRMED` and persists the change\n   - Returns the unchanged shipment for idempotent calls when already `CONFIRMED`\n   - Returns 409 Conflict for `CANCELLED` shipments\n\n3. **`ShipmentControllerTest.kt`**: Added 4 comprehensive tests covering:\n   - Confirming a created shipment transitions to confirmed status\n   - Idempotent retry behavior (confirm again, no change)\n   - Rejection of cancelled shipment with 409 error code\n   - Rejection of non-existent shipment with 404 error code\n\n### Acceptance Criteria ✅\n\n- **Build & Tests**: All 17 tests pass (5 existing + 4 new + 8 other features)\n- **Endpoint**: `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` works as specified\n- **Error Handling**: Consistent with existing API using `ApiError` envelope\n- **Idempotency**: Repeated confirms succeed without side effects\n- **State Validation**: Cancelled shipments rejected, missing shipments return 404\n- **No New Dependencies**: Only code modifications, no Maven changes\n- **Scoped Changes**: Only shipment feature files modified"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":420,"cache_read_input_tokens":43262,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":420},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"st